I’ve been studying Persian for a few years, and countless times I’ve come across words I couldn’t ask my teacher right away how to pronounce. For this, no other tool I tried has been as helpful as&nbsp;**Forvo**: a crowd-sourced pronunciation dictionary for every language. That’s why, when I was asked to choose an app for my UX case study, as part of my career development from UI towards User Experience, Forvo immediately felt like the perfect fit.
